; PFC2D entry: restore the waste-rock model and run the FiPy coupling.
;
; Usage: open and run this file in PFC2D. Paths are absolute so it works
; regardless of the PFC working directory.
;
; NOTE: use FORWARD slashes in PFC paths. A backslash is an escape character in
; PFC strings and gets stripped, which corrupts Windows paths.
;
; This first version only reads porosity from the model and reports it; it does
; not yet run the flow solve or write back to ball extras.

restore 'D:/PFC item/pfc_fipy_model1/sample.p2sav'
call 'D:/work/pfc-fipy-coupling/pfc/run_coupling.py'
